  triage:title "Two of the sprint doc's 7 named required-positive files do not match the actually enforced files" ;
  triage:description "Sprint doc names crates/atm-core/src/read/mod.rs and crates/atm-daemon/src/runtime_health.rs as mandatory required-positive targets. The checker's REQUIRED dict instead enforces read/request.rs and runtime_health/dispatch.rs. runtime_health.rs contains zero occurrences of touch_member or any observation token -- it is only optionally allowed, not mandatory as the doc claims. Found by req-qa. QA source: PR #742, phase-aj-s7-qa-1." ;
